              "content": "This endpoint is deprecated in favour of [create payment](ref:createpolicypayment). This endpoint validates the input and queues payments to be processed asynchronously. A response of `200 OK` is sent if the payments are valid and have been successfully queued. This endpoint allows for up to 5000 payments to be created at a time. To use this endpoint you'll need the `Payments Create` permission.\n",
